<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:50:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>美国通胀数据助长加息押注，金价小幅走低</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes</link><description>金价在周三上涨后小幅走低，因通胀数据强化了美联储将进一步加息的押注。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes'&gt;美国通胀数据助长加息押注，金价小幅走低&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Wavers After Battering as Traders Assess Fed Path, AI Angst&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英国因寒流而面临电力供应紧张的第三天</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap</link><description>英国周四再次面临电力供应紧张，寒流提振需求，导致电力供应紧张局面延续。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap'&gt;英国因寒流而面临电力供应紧张的第三天&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UK Faces Third Day of Strained Electricity Supplies on Cold Snap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:05:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>载有柴油的船在西班牙伊维萨岛附近沉没，一人死亡</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/diesel-carrying-ship-sinks-off-spanish-island-of-ibiza-one-dead</link><description>据巴利阿里群岛紧急服务部门称，一艘载有柴油的船只在西班牙伊维萨岛海岸沉没。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/diesel-carrying-ship-sinks-off-spanish-island-of-ibiza-one-dead'&gt;载有柴油的船在西班牙伊维萨岛附近沉没，一人死亡&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Diesel-Carrying Ship Sinks Off Spanish Island of Ibiza, One Dead&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/diesel-carrying-ship-sinks-off-spanish-island-of-ibiza-one-dead</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:24:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着转向英国金边债券的暂停，富时 100 指数反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/ftse-100-eyes-rebound-as-shift-to-uk-gilts-pauses</link><description>另外，仔细看看英国消费者的困惑&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/ftse-100-eyes-rebound-as-shift-to-uk-gilts-pauses'&gt;随着转向英国金边债券的暂停，富时 100 指数反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：FTSE 100 Eyes Rebound as Shift to UK Gilts Pauses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/ftse-100-eyes-rebound-as-shift-to-uk-gilts-pauses</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:37:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中东和非洲地平线 2026 年 11 月 26 日（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/horizons-middle-east-africa-11-26-2026-video</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/horizons-middle-east-africa-11-26-2026-video'&gt;中东和非洲地平线 2026 年 11 月 26 日（视频）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Horizons Middle East &amp; Africa 11/26/2026 (Video)&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/horizons-middle-east-africa-11-26-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:41:56 +0000</pubDate></item></ch